    "Fixed original candidate pools and fixed 2.4s/.25s grid for all modes. Candidate cache is read-only; missing compatible cache is charged B01 inference.",
    "Accompanied reference uses first constructed phrase from existing exact-instance mixture; retrieval candidate has alternate performance, possibly shared background. This is a correlated diagnostic, not independent source-family generalisation.",
